# The secrets this Worker takes. Cloudflare's Deploy button reads this file
# for their names, and a value given here turns up in its form as if it had
# been filled in. So none is given: the field starts empty.
#
# For wrangler dev, copy this file to .dev.vars, which git ignores, and fill
# it in.
#
# ADMIN_SECRET is the password of the admin page and of the admin API. At
# least 16 characters. Without one that long the admin API is not there
# (404), and the admin page says how to set one.
ADMIN_SECRET=
